{"4659660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Graveyard Cabin", "steam_appid": 4659660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4756170], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>An Interactive FMV Anomaly Experience: Watch the Tapes, Watch Your Back.</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong> </strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graveyard Cabin </strong>is a psychological FMV anomaly horror game where observation is your only weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work the night shift inside an isolated graveyard security cabin and monitor a network of black-and-white surveillance cameras. Detect anomalies, report supernatural activity, and survive until morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.poster.avif?t=1786460882\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.webm?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/2494bb953e0335cf6ee5a4fe12899118.mp4?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spot the Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorize every corner of the graveyard and carefully monitor the live camera feeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a gravestone moves, a figure appears, or something changes unexpectedly, report it before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too many false reports will anger the entities hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 3 chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.poster.avif?t=1786460882\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.webm?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/d1ef7d808c6d11077bbcbc79005fa535.mp4?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If You Hear Crying, Hide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every anomaly should be observed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hear the crying of a little girl, immediately shut down the cameras and stay silent in the dark until the sound disappears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking too long may attract something you cannot escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.poster.avif?t=1786460882\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.webm?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/7f15ec8b30e49289b213b012800bed59.mp4?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Cabin Is Not Safe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The danger is not limited to the cameras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While monitoring the graveyard, supernatural entities can appear inside the cabin itself. Check the internal cabin camera frequently and stay alert to movement beside you… or directly behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The observer can quickly become the victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.poster.avif?t=1786460882\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.webm?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4659660/extras/d150a666c188b64c8950624ba90af14a.mp4?t=1786460882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend</strong> <strong>Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an entity breaches the cabin, you must react instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Cross against hostile creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Amulet to banish the Dead Woman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the wrong item or hesitate for even a second and your shift will end permanently. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological FMV horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly detection gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple supernatural entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surveillance camera monitoring mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio-based survival mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive item system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing tension and paranoia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive graveyard atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_par